Dialogue: 3,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.31,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)}我閃閃發光
Dialogue: 3,0:01:23.40,0:01:24.31,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}抬起頭看看吧
Dialogue: 3,0:01:24.31,0:01:26.48,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,240)\an3\pos(1850,975)}抬起頭看看吧
